aditionally, at time </span><em><strong>t</strong></em><span>, SSMs:</span>=
</p><ul><li><p><span>map an input sequence </span><em><strong>x(t)</strong>=
</em><span> =E2=80=94 (e.g., moved left and down in the maze)</span></p></l=
i><li><p><span>to a latent state representation </span><em><strong>h(t)</st=
rong></em><span> =E2=80=94  (e.g., distance to exit and x/y coordinates)</s=
