><strong>y(t)</strong></em><span> =E2=80=94 (e.g., move left again to reach=
 the exit sooner)</span></p></li></ul><p><span>However, instead of using </=
span><em>discrete</em><span> </span><em>sequences</em><span> (like moving l=
