intermediate) results through </span><em>parallel scan</em><span>, </span><=
em>kernel fusion</em><span>, and </span><em>recomputation</em><span>.</span=
></p></li></ol><p><span>Together they create the </span><em>selective SSM</=
em><span> or </span><em>S6</em><span> models which can be used, like self-a=
ttention, to create </span><em>Mamba blocks</em><span>.</span></p><p>Before=
 exploring the two main contributions, let=E2=80=99s first explore why they=
